WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:08.607
Three steps: your form,
your people, your staff.

2
00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:18.420
Your people: paste the roster
your old system exports.

3
00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:26.888
Check what it read
before anything is added.

4
00:00:26.888 --> 00:00:31.859
Four people added.
Nobody retyped a thing.

5
00:00:31.859 --> 00:00:35.353
Then your staff.

6
00:00:35.353 --> 00:00:40.891
Their role, and the title
they sign with.

7
00:00:40.891 --> 00:00:46.233
Send them the link.
It works once per person.
